{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07765","headline":"同卢明府饯张郎中除义王府司马海园作 · 孟浩然","name":"同卢明府饯张郎中除义王府司马海园作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国山河列，贤王邸第开。\n故人分职去，潘令宠行来。\n冠盖趋梁苑，江湘失楚材。\n豫愁轩骑动，宾客散池台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}